From e0c08b8be24e0f40352015e035761f9bf3aecbc7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wangyunhua <wangyunhua3@contributor>

Date: Tue, 30 Dec 2025 11:52:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add test cases for BIT data type in parallel
 query.

Issue:
------
previous commit bab327372c54ce0a005616ab9ee8ae22c1393450  removes parts of the
BIT-specific handling logic in parallel query, including forced Item::MARKER_BIT
marking for hidden BIT items.

Solution:
--------
Add new MTR test cases to cover BIT aggregates, expressions, and GROUP BY scenarios,
and to ensure consistent results between parallel and serial execution.
---
 .../parallel_query/r/pq_bugfix.result-pq      | 338 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../suite/parallel_query/t/pq_bugfix.test     | 132 +++++++
 2 files changed, 470 insertions(+)

diff --git a/mysql-test/suite/parallel_query/r/pq_bugfix.result-pq b/mysql-test/suite/parallel_query/r/pq_bugfix.result-pq
